# Build output, gitignored, and prettier walks it anyway.
#
# IT HAS TO LIVE HERE, and the workspace root's file is not a substitute: `nx
# format` runs prettier once per PROJECT with the project as the working
# directory, and prettier resolves `.prettierignore` from the cwd. Measured —
# `prettier --check dist/accordion-content.css` from this folder flags the file
# while the identical pattern sits unread at the root.
#
# The symptom is worth naming because it is ordering-dependent and therefore
# invisible in CI: green on a clean checkout, and after a local `build` or
# `build-storybook` prettier EXITS 2 on emitted files it cannot parse, so `nx
# format:write` — the command the definition of done tells you to run — fails
# outright and writes nothing.
dist
out-tsc
storybook-static
.storybook/manager-theme.generated.ts
